                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more augustly"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "a0320ec8-9e90-40d8-af79-03105790b6a4",
                        "entry_id": "1d4f3ef7-a92d-3c7b-8a5b-9a1f2624fefc",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most augustly"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "af97ce4b-6ae0-30aa-925b-927afa36837b",
                        "entry_id": "1d4f3ef7-a92d-3c7b-8a5b-9a1f2624fefc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In an august or awe-inspiring manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb6de8c0-81bd-4651-b8d4-a259ebf7e2fe",
                                "sense_id": "af97ce4b-6ae0-30aa-925b-927afa36837b",
                                "text": "For surely, sir, you will not assert, that a duty can be binding which is not founded on reason? If, indeed, this be their destination, arguments may be drawn from reason; and thus augustly supported, the more understanding women acquire, the more they will be attached to their duty, comprehending it […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c071aa1-7dc3-48d5-bfa2-496008260802",
                                "sense_id": "af97ce4b-6ae0-30aa-925b-927afa36837b",
                                "text": "St. Mark’s is perfect. To me it soon grew to be so nobly, so augustly ugly, that it was difficult to stay away from it, even for a little while."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a132d247-f9da-4923-8421-f03728132a9f",
                                "sense_id": "af97ce4b-6ae0-30aa-925b-927afa36837b",
                                "text": "Deliberately, almost ‘augustly,’ the gowned and mortar-boarded figures followed one another through the great red turnstile and filed into the chamber beyond."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3889830e-2b44-33f1-96ed-5647a1959b19",
                        "entry_id": "1d4f3ef7-a92d-3c7b-8a5b-9a1f2624fefc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a royal or regal manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "94bd6705-aedf-42c0-a56e-8ea9c89410ea",
                                "sense_id": "3889830e-2b44-33f1-96ed-5647a1959b19",
                                "text": "The Heavenly Sovereign made a progress to the abode of I-suke-yori-hime, and augustly slept (there) one night."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b7f035f-8d32-4ff6-83db-b30217b0adcb",
                                "sense_id": "3889830e-2b44-33f1-96ed-5647a1959b19",
                                "text": "On His Majesty's arrival, the wine was respectfully presented to him, when the Sovereign sang augustly, saying: ..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f331d452-c6a8-4af7-a2d7-62561b88c735",
                                "sense_id": "3889830e-2b44-33f1-96ed-5647a1959b19",
                                "text": "But wait until the Honorable Ma Chun-shing arrives and you shall see that I am augustly disposed to consent to your marriage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "73a5556c-9102-4274-af20-b4a6375c5a49",
                                "sense_id": "3889830e-2b44-33f1-96ed-5647a1959b19",
                                "text": "He augustly began. Our First Ancestor At Kyǒnghŭng resided, And his royal work He augustly began."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a954dd3b-4973-476a-8d97-fd5276d533ee",
                                "sense_id": "3889830e-2b44-33f1-96ed-5647a1959b19",
                                "text": "We have reigned Augustly; let our part be so sustained That Time, far hence, shall hold our memory dear !"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
